11	 *
12	 * **A map is not a tree**, so the outline is a spanning tree: start at the claims
13	 * nothing causes, walk out along the wires in the order the map lists them, and
14	 * give every claim exactly one item, at its first arrival. A claim with several
15	 * causes does not appear twice; instead its own sentence names every wire coming
16	 * into it. Nothing is lost and the tree stays a tree.
17	 *
